      "id": "anchor",
      "markdown": "## What you are looking at\n\n- **What:** how the orders worker retries a failed job (issue 41).\n- **Why it matters:** in staging, 4 of 1,200 jobs failed three times and none was lost.\n- **Where it stands:** staged; retry load during a payments outage was not measured.\n- **You decide:** sign off on the design or not."
